WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.830
<b>This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, organizations, laws, etc.</b>

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.830
<b>are products of the author's imagination or used fictitiously.</b>

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:04.000
What?!

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.830
But why?! It's tradition!

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.130
You won free tickets?

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.420
Valid for that day only...?

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.460
Right...

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:15.710
Okay, I understand... Bye.

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.710
Is something the matter?

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.330
Well...

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.080
I told you that my family runs a dojo, right?

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:27.960
Yeah.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:32.210
A lot of their students are children,
so they throw a Christmas party every year.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.750
They hand out candy and presents, stuff like that.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.040
Wow, that must be fun!

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:38.920
But...

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:43.210
they're going out of town, so I'll have to run
the entire thing by myself this year...

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.000
That's a shame...

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.710
Sounds like a tough job.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:51.380
Okay, then. I'll lend you a hand!

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:54.580
We'll put my Home Ec Club and
Childhood Studies skills to the test!

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.750
Atena...

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:58.380
But keep in mind that I'm only a first-year.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.080
I'll help out, too.

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:03.080
Thanks, you guys.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:07.250
How about we plan on going shopping
together on our next day off?

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:08.330
Sure!

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.330
Shiranai furi o shiteru dake desho?

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:26.380
<b>Mother of the Goddess' Dormitory</b>

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:26.250
Hitomi no oku ni honne deteru yo

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:29.250
Dramatic na koi nanka janai

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:32.880
Hotetta karada toketeshimaisou

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:35.830
Hontou wa tereteru dake

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:38.790
Okufukaku ijirasete yo

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:41.540
Konna fuku kisasechau no

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:44.540
Kimi dake ni hora dokidoki shiteru

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:49.960
Aru ga mama nasu ga mama nagasarete

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.960
Glass no mukou nozokikondara

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:56.380
Tsuyameku sweety na sekai

00:01:56.670 --> 00:02:01.830
Mukiatte dakishimete kowareru hodo

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.790
Kimi no kodou ga kanjireru kurai

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:07.170
Soba ni kite hoshii na

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.500
Torokesou na love

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.790
Itazura na ai de kimi no koto madowasu no

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:15.330
Torokesou na love

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:20.080
Shitai koto zenbu suki ni shite kamawanai yo

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.790
Yubisaki de nazotte

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:26.250
Amai amai yume misete ageru yo

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.880
Kuchibiru o mitsumete

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.040
I wanna kiss you motto motto

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:44.040
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:44.040
<b>Kiriya Wishes Upon a Christmas</b>

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.540
A trip into town with Kiriya and Koushi...

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.130
A Christmas party...

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:00.830
Sounds like a blast.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.290
S-sorry! I-I should've knocked...!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:18.250
I-it's my fault... I-I should've showered last night...

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.290
I'm sorry!

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:23.250
Ouch...

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.460
M..Miss Atena-!

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.630
Go on... without me!

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:48.130
I'm sorry. I can't go.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.830
What happened?!

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.250
It was my fault! I'm so, so sorry!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.420
Koushi didn't do anything wro-

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.500
I-it's alright! There's no need to strain yourself!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.170
I'm really sorry!

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.330
I'll do twice the work to make up for it.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.420
I'll carry all the bags!

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:05.670
Koushi...

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:07.670
Let's get going. To the store!

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:08.670
Just us two!

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:13.040
O-okay...

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.880
Th-then you stay here and get some rest, Atena.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.540
I will. Sorry again.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.420
A-are you ready, Koushi?

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.170
Oooh?

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:25.710
Kiriya, Koushi... Are you going on a date?

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:27.330
I'm so jealous!

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.830
I-IT'S NOT LIKE THAT!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.580
Huh?!
I-IT'S NOT LIKE THAT!<b></b>

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:31.880
Huh?!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.130
Please wait for me, Miss Kiriya!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.420
Mmm, good ol' fresh air.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.000
So cold...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.630
Whoops, sorry. I'll fix the door.

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:52.790
So, what should we start with?

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.000
Good question...

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.580
First, let's get some snacks or
something light for the party.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.790
After that, we can pick out their presents.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.000
Gotcha.

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:04.540
Whoa, a blast from the past!

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.750
Aw, these are adorable.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:09.130
Did you eat these a lot as a kid, too?

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:13.380
No... The dojo was pretty strict about
snacking between meals.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.750
I always wished I could buy stuff like this.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.080
Alright, then let's buy a ton of 'em!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.080
Yeah!

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.000
Miss Kiriya?

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.500
Oh, my bad.

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.460
Let's go in there next.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:36.460
Okay.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:42.000
Whaddya think of this?

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.210
I like it.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.080
Really?

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:44.830
We'll do this one, and...

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:45.540
We're on a date, y'know.
We'll do this one, and...<b></b>

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:46.170
We're on a date, y'know.

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:48.210
Wouldn't rather go to
an amusement park or something?

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:51.210
Picking out ornaments together
is just as much fun, don't you think?

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:52.790
It makes for a cozy date.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.580
What a cool tree...

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.750
Miss Kiriya, are you getting hungry?

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:48.000
Huh? Oh, I guess so.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.500
So good!

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.170
Yeah? I'm glad.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:02.330
Th-th-this really is a d-d-date!

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:05.540
Look at that girl over there. She's gorgeous!

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.420
Her little brother's cute, too.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.250
Good looks must run in their family.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.210
Totally.

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:14.170
Th-that's right. Usually, we're like siblings...

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:21.130
How exactly does Koushi think of me, I wonder?

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.000
Like a sister?

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.960
Or maybe like a brother?

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.670
I bet if I was Atena...

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.630
Wait, am I jealous? Of Atena?

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:34.130
But why...?

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:38.330
How exactly do I want Koushi to think of me?

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.710
There are so many different toys!

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.380
It's hard to choose, isn't it?

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:45.790
Look over here, Miss Kiriya!

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.210
Who thought that was a good idea?!

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:51.670
It wouldn't be so bad
if the reindeer wasn't human!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.290
That's too hilarious!

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:59.380
Lately, Koushi's gotten comfortable enough
to laugh like a kid his age normally would...

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:03.330
Now I'm acting like an older sister!
Make up your mind, Kiriya!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.040
Oh, that reminds me.
Are you going to pretend to be Santa

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:09.750
for the kids at the Christmas party, Miss Kiriya?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.040
I hadn't thought about it.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.330
My dad is usually the one who does that...

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:16.130
But maybe I oughtta dress up this time.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.460
I could wear a beard...

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.540
A beard?! Seriously?!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.710
No way, that'd be a waste.

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:30.290
If you were to ask Miss Frey, I think she'd suggest
a fancy Santa costume like this one.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.250
A special gift just for you.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:44.080
Wait, why the heck did I imagine that?!

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.420
She'd probably even make one for you!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:51.290
I feel like Miss Frey has been
a bad influence on me lately...

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:54.960
B-but a cute outfit like this...
Shouldn't Atena wear it instead?

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:56.380
How come?

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.000
Masculine clothes suit me.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.790
That's the vibe I give off, right?

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.040
Huh?

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:06.630
Well, I thought you were awesome
at the school festival,

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:10.000
and everyone on campus
might have certain expectations...

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.170
See? I figured-

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:14.830
But you don't necessarily have to dress
in a specific way, Miss Kiriya.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:16.500
Not in my opinion, at least.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:23.460
I think you should try wearing
feminine clothes more often.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:25.290
They would look great on you.

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:29.250
R-really...?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.330
Th-that's just my opinion, though!

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:35.790
E-er, um...

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:36.830
Ah, okay...
E-er, um...<b></b>

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.000
L-let's head home and
ask Miss Frey for some advice!

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:43.750
Yaaay! Just leave the fashion part to me!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:46.210
I'll make the cutest outfit you've ever seen!

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:49.540
I hope that's alright.
Costume design isn't exactly the easiest job...

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.330
I enjoy it, so that doesn't bother me.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:52.750
Thanks, Frey.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:53.830
It's no problem.

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:57.290
If it were any other day, I would love to
lend a hand with the Christmas party.

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:59.960
But unfortunately, I have a prior commitment...

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.960
And since there's more work
to be done before then,

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:05.460
we should get started on
your costume immediately!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:06.250
Immediately?!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.040
First, we'll take your measurements.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.960
It's important to use the latest data available!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.540
She's practically giddy...

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:15.250
W-well, I'll be on my way.

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:16.540
THERE'S NO ESCAPE!

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.880
What?! But why?!

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:21.210
Are you taking my measurements, too?!

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:24.830
Of course.
What is Santa without his trusty reindeer?

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:26.460
<b>Rumble...</b>

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:26.460
<b>Eek!</b>

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.460
That look is terrifying!

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.210
Now then, let's start with Kiriya.

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:29.710
Take off your clothes.

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:30.960
Wh-what...?!

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:33.080
Aw, are you feeling shy?

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.540
In that case, I can take them off for you.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:37.500
B-but Koushi is watching...!

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:38.830
S-sorry!

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:42.670
There, you see? Koushi's eyes are shut tight.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.000
C'mon, take off your shirt.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:45.880
'Kay...

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:48.080
Good. Let's take off your pants next.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.080
H-huh?!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.960
What a cute butt!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.250
Hey, cut it out...

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.710
Here comes the tape measure.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:56.710
Lift your arms.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:57.500
'Kay...

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.290
D-do you have to put it there...?

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:03.000
Bear with me, okay?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:05.580
So sensitive.

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:06.960
What about here?

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.000
Such a pretty sound...

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.040
They're poisoning my innocent mind!

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:22.380
I can't go today, either.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:25.080
On the day of the Christmas party,
no less. I'm sorry!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.460
I made the same mistake!

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:28.880
I-it's alright. Just get some rest!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.880
Frey was kind enough to make
a Santa costume for Atena,

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:34.040
but I guess we're going to have an extra...

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.920
I'll be sure to apologize to Miss Frey later.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.460
The skies are clear.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.210
The view of the Moon will be unhindered.

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:47.210
Tonight is the optimal night to
employ lunar technology...

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:52.250
Once accustomed to this door,
it evokes a quaint sort of charm.

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:53.960
However...

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.210
My bad...

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:58.790
That reminds me, Serene.
Can you do me a favor?

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.130
What will you offer?

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.040
<b>Crab Moon Crackers</b>

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.080
This is it.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:21.460
This is my childhood-home-turned-martial-arts-studio.

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:22.630
Whoa!

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.000
Big Sis!

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.380
It's Kiriya!

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:30.170
Are you going to be our teacher today?

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.290
That's right.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.500
You sure are popular, Miss Kiriya.

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.960
They're good kids. Very well-behaved.

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:40.210
Big Sis, who're these guys?

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:42.040
Are you Miss Kiriya's little brother?

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.210
Sure am!

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:44.380
Nice to meet you.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.630
Are they new students?

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:50.960
Nah. These two are here to help me out
with the Christmas party after practice-

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.170
Then that means they're total rookies!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.250
Uh, hold on a second...

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.380
Hooray! Two more dojo buddies!

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.290
Yay!

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:58.130
Wait!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.540
First, you gotta get changed.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.170
Huh?

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.670
Koushi?! Serene?!

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:05.750
Sorry...

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:10.920
So, why are we wearing uniforms...?

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.830
Is Serene meant to participate...?

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.540
Welcome to the Basics of Judo.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:15.790
Let's get started!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.040
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.580
We'll begin with falling techniques.

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:21.580
I'm going to throw you,
and you're going to practice falling.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.790
'Kay!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.290
Miss Kiriya is really talented.

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:27.920
She can do all sorts of different martial arts.

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:32.250
If I remember correctly, she was doing Tai Chi
in front of the dorm the other day...

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.630
You're up next, Koushi!

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:35.670
O-okay!

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.000
Uh...

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:40.880
Don't worry.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.330
This method is a totally safe way of...

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:48.830
S-s-sorry!

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:51.130
What was I thinking, attacking an amateur...?!

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.670
It's alright. I'm getting a sense of déjà vu...

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:56.170
Something like this happened once before, didn't it?

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:57.960
Oh God, please forgive me!

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:00.420
Just relax and take a breather, okay?!

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:01.330
Gotcha...

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:05.080
Hey, are you okay?

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.040
Oh yeah, I'll be fine.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:10.080
Are you a whatchamacallit?
My big sister's lackey?

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:10.920
Huh?

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:14.080
Y'know. When she says, "Jump,"
you say, "How high?"

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:15.380
Ha-ha...

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.080
These kids aren't shy, that's for sure...

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:22.880
From the sound of it, Miss Kiriya's little brother
has a very interesting perception of her...

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:27.210
I don't really think of her like that, though...

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:28.790
Okay, get ready!

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:29.630
Right.

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:41.080
Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:42.790
Koushi, was that...?!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.420
Well I am the dorm mother!

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.920
Alright! Let's wrap it up for today.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.460
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:53.790
To be honest, I'm kind of tired already...

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:55.290
But the show must go on!

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:58.580
'Kay, gather 'round!

00:14:58.790 --> 00:14:59.750
We'll need to make some preparations
before Santa and his helpers come to visit.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.330
Hi, Mr. Reindeer!
We'll need to make some preparations<b>
</b>before Santa and his helpers come to visit.<b></b>

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.290
We'll need to make some preparations
before Santa and his helpers come to visit.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.380
What kind of preparations?

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:08.250
Putting up a few decorations, and handing out these...

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:15.330
<b>Good Kid</b>

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:10.790
Reindeer Deluxe Good Kid Badges!

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:15.330
If you wear one and wait patiently,
Santa will bring you a special present later!

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:16.330
A badge...?

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:17.920
We want presents, but...

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.170
We'll pass on the badge.

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:20.170
What?!

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.830
I thought it was a cool idea...

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:26.040
And I spent hours making them...

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.790
Kids sure are hard to please...

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.420
What's wrong? Tired from practice?

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.040
N-no...

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.080
The presents.

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.290
The presents?

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.750
Only good kids get presents, right?

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:58.330
I'm the worst student in class...

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:01.290
I don't deserve a present.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:04.880
And I'm not brave enough
to go play with everyone else...

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:09.710
Ah... I'm sorry.

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:12.960
That wasn't what I had in mind
when I made those badges.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.420
But I get what you mean.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:22.330
Having the courage to make friends is hard
when you feel like an outsider...

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:34.000
Sometimes I wonder if I even deserve them...

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:37.000
Mister...?

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:44.080
But seriously, that wasn't my intention
when I made those badges.

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.920
Skill has nothing to do with it.

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:50.460
They're for anyone and everyone
who tried their hardest.

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:53.460
You didn't slack off or skip practice, did you?

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:54.460
No.

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:55.960
Then you'll be fine.

00:16:57.170 --> 00:16:58.500
Santa will come to see you.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.130
<b>Good Kid</b>

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:12.630
He'll bring you presents, I'm sure of it.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:15.960
Yeah.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.210
Wait a minute.

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:20.630
Why didn't you tell us it was
an award in the first place?

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:22.500
In that case, I'll take one!

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.960
Besides, you put a whole lotta effort
into making them, didn'tcha?

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:27.210
Yeah, good point!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.170
Aw, you guys...

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:30.920
You're the best!

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.540
There's no need to cry.

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.000
We're sorry, okay?

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:37.380
C'mon, let's finish decorating
and whip this place into shape!

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:38.880
Yeah!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.580
Sorry for the wait, guys!

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.080
It's time for presents!

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:01.210
How pretty...

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:03.420
Hey, where'd you buy that costume?!

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:05.830
A friend of mine made it for me.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:09.080
Wh-what do you think, Koushi?

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:22.630
I-it's very nice.

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:25.290
I think you look great.

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:26.960
R-really?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.960
Big Sis is wearing a skirt?!

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:36.130
She's not even wearing shorts underneath!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.130
KNOCK IT OFF, ALREADY!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:38.380
Oh nooooo!
KNOCK IT OFF, ALREADY!<b></b>

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.710
There's the Big Sis I know...

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.080
Hurry up and hand out the presents!

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.170
Okay!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.920
That's a cute kitty you got there.

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:03.330
Wanna come sit with us and eat some snacks?

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.290
Sure.

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:06.540
Thank goodness...

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.540
It looks like she's enjoying the party.

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:11.290
And everyone liked the presents we picked out.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:14.670
Hey, Mr. Reindeer. Quit slacking off.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.290
Isn't it your job to let Santa ride on your back?

00:19:17.290 --> 00:19:18.040
Huh?

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:21.080
I seem to remember there being a sleigh involved...

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:22.630
Hop on, Big Sis.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.290
Wh-wh-what?! Are you kidding?!

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.000
Fine, then she can go first.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.170
But it's my turn next, okay?

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:30.670
C'mon, crouch down.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:31.750
For real...?

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:33.000
He has a point.

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:36.040
In terms of the dynamic between
superior and subordinate individuals...

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.290
this serves as an apt illustration.

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:40.750
I don't think that's an
appropriate lesson for children!

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.420
Let us begin.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:44.670
Wait, Miss Serene-

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:49.500
Whoosh.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:56.130
<b>Rub...</b>

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.040
This sensation on my back...

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:57.670
Don't tell me...

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.880
Um, Miss Serene?

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:03.000
Sorry for the awkward question, but...

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:05.670
Are you wearing anything underneath your-

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:06.500
No.

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:08.580
The holy robes are perfect.

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:12.040
They would lose their significance
if marred by additional garments.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:16.210
Giddy-up.

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:29.290
I'm gonna make a break for the changing room!

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:31.580
Hold on tight, Miss Serene!

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:33.920
Hey, come back...!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.210
See ya!
Bye-bye!<b></b>

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:48.540
Good work out there, Koushi.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.960
You did a great job too, Miss Kiriya.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:55.040
The kids had a blast.

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.130
And I owe it all to you.

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:58.170
Thanks.

00:20:58.170 --> 00:20:59.540
It's no big deal.

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:04.380
I wish I'd gotten you a present,
but it totally slipped my mind.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:05.380
I'm sorry.

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.330
Nah, don't worry about it.

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:15.540
What's this...?

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:20.920
A present for Santa from her trusty reindeer...

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:23.040
The Hard Worker Award!

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:25.330
Koushi...

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.790
I-I-I wasn't doing anything-!

